---------------------------------------------------------------------
Visual direction: a premium, realistic, professional emergency-management product, like a modern municipal command dashboard combined with a public service portal. It must NOT look like a children's app, cartoon, infographic or generic template. Calm, bright, trustworthy, easy to understand in 5 seconds.

Colours (use only these):
- White #FFFFFF: main page background.
- Light grey #F4F6FA: alternate sections and dashboard background.
- Border #E2E7F0: thin borders and dividers.
- Deep navy #101A3A: alert ticker, headings, dark panels, emergency contact strip.
- Primary blue #2457C5: links, active menu item, selected chips, map controls, secondary buttons.
- Emergency red #D32F2F: used ONLY for Report Hazard, critical severity, live-wire warnings and the emergency strip.
