SECTION 7. OFFLINE-FIRST BEHAVIOUR
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Register a service worker that caches the app shell, translation table, sample data, help points and the schematic map so the app opens with no network.
- All data lives in localStorage (and IndexedDB for photos, compressed to about 1 MB each). The app reads from local data first.
- New reports made offline are saved with status "Queued", a rule-based score and a "Queued" badge. A banner shows how many reports are waiting. When the connection returns, they sync automatically (retry with a short delay if a send fails), then the badge changes to Pending and the AI score replaces the rule score when available.
